---js
{
  layout: "layouts/base.njk",
  title: "Trophies",
  seoTitle: "GTA 6 Trophy Guide and Platinum Roadmap: All Trophies and Achievements",
  description: "Every GTA 6 trophy and achievement with a platinum roadmap, missable warnings and a checklist that saves your progress.",
  eleventyComputed: {
    sample: (data) => !!data.db.trophies.sample,
    updated: (data) => data.db.trophies.updated,
  },
}
---
{%- set t = db.trophies %}
{%- set gradeName = { platinum: "Platinum", gold: "Gold", silver: "Silver", bronze: "Bronze" } %}
<header class="mast" style="--glow:var(--plat)">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="kicker">Trophies and achievements</p>
    <h1>The Platinum Road</h1>
    <p class="tagline">A phased route to the platinum, and a trophy list you can tick off as you go.</p>
    {%- if t.items.length %}
    <div class="tiles">
      <div class="tile p"><div class="v">{{ t.counts.platinum }}</div><div class="k">Platinum</div></div>
      <div class="tile g"><div class="v">{{ t.counts.gold }}</div><div class="k">Gold</div></div>
      <div class="tile"><div class="v">{{ t.counts.silver }}</div><div class="k">Silver</div></div>
      <div class="tile"><div class="v">{{ t.counts.bronze }}</div><div class="k">Bronze</div></div>
      {%- if t.estimate and t.estimate.time %}<div class="tile"><div class="v">{{ t.estimate.time }}</div><div class="k">Est. time</div></div>{% endif %}
    </div>
    <div class="progress" data-progress="trophy:" data-total="{{ t.items.length }}">
      <div class="row"><span class="lab">Your progress</span><span class="pct"><span data-done>0</span> / {{ t.items.length }} · <span data-pct>0%</span></span></div>
      <div class="bar"><i></i></div>
    </div>
    {%- endif %}
  </div>
</header>

{%- if not t.items.length %}
<section class="sec">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="empty">
      <p class="kicker">Waiting for the real list</p>
      <h2 class="sec-h sm">No official trophy list yet</h2>
      <p>When this page was last updated, on November 18, 2026, the game had just unlocked in New Zealand. Several sites have since posted a list of 55 trophies, but none of them says where it comes from, they disagree on the trophy grades, and it matches the list that was passed around before launch. Until we can check it against the consoles or a tracker synced from them, you will not find it here.</p>
      <p>The real list goes up on this page, with a platinum roadmap and missable warnings, as soon as it appears on the consoles.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
{%- else %}
{%- if t.roadmap and t.roadmap.length %}
<section class="sec">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2 class="sec-h">The roadmap</h2>
    <p class="lede">The efficient order: play the story first, mop up the open world, then clean up what is left.</p>
    <div class="phases">
      {%- for p in t.roadmap %}
      <div class="phase"><div class="num">{{ loop.index }}</div><div><h3>{{ p.title }}</h3><p>{{ p.text }}</p></div></div>
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
{%- endif %}

<section class="sec">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2 class="sec-h">Trophy list</h2>
    <p class="lede">Hidden trophies stay blurred until you reveal them or turn spoilers on.</p>
    <div class="filters" data-filter-group="trophies" role="group" aria-label="Filter trophies">
      <button type="button" class="fchip is-on" data-filter="*" aria-pressed="true">All</button>
      <button type="button" class="fchip" data-filter="todo" aria-pressed="false">Not earned</button>
      <button type="button" class="fchip" data-filter="missable" aria-pressed="false">Missable</button>
      <button type="button" class="fchip" data-filter="story" aria-pressed="false">Story</button>
      <button type="button" class="fchip" data-filter="open-world" aria-pressed="false">Open world</button>
      <button type="button" class="fchip" data-filter="collectibles" aria-pressed="false">Collectibles</button>
    </div>
    <div class="trophies" data-filter-list="trophies">
      {%- for tr in t.items %}
      <div class="tr{% if tr.hidden %} is-secret{% endif %}" data-track-row data-tags="{{ tr.tags | join(' ') }}{% if tr.missable %} missable{% endif %}{% if tr.hidden %} hidden{% endif %}">
        <input class="cb" type="checkbox" id="t-{{ tr.id }}" data-track="trophy:{{ tr.id }}" aria-label="Mark trophy {{ loop.index }} earned">
        <div class="body">
          <div class="name"><span class="secret">{{ tr.name }}</span></div>
          <div class="desc"><span class="secret">{{ tr.desc }}</span></div>
          {%- if tr.how %}<details class="how"><summary>How to get it</summary><p>{{ tr.how | md | safe }}</p></details>{% endif %}
          {%- if tr.link and not tr.hidden %}<a class="more" href="{{ tr.link }}">Related guide</a>{% endif %}
        </div>
        <div class="side">
          <span class="rar {{ tr.grade }}">{{ gradeName[tr.grade] }}</span>
          {%- if tr.missable %}<span class="flag">Missable</span>{% endif %}
          {%- if tr.hidden %}<button type="button" class="flag hid" data-reveal>Hidden · reveal</button>{% endif %}
        </div>
      </div>
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>
    <p class="nomatch" data-nomatch="trophies" hidden>No trophies match that filter.</p>
    <button class="reset" type="button" data-reset="trophy:">Reset tracker</button>
  </div>
</section>
{%- endif %}
